{"login": "OnThaCode", "location": "Washington, DC", "commits": [{"sha": "266b033bf336e8f62866fb6d8b5af9be718a99ed", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2025-06-25T14:28:18Z", "repo": "OnThaCode", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1634dc2466f75a4bc50e296143be929b11bb377c", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2024-11-05T16:39:18Z", "repo": "OnThaCode", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "eade296a025cec8b2cf385104a9ce793e40e10eb", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2024-10-24T17:07:01Z", "repo": "OnThaCode", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "08944da9c8d0a7b82fe52f440fe9117df5544f05", "message": "Create README.md", "created_at": "2023-09-11T03:45:03Z", "repo": "OnThaCode", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ed694d8f692aed5fd30bdb035b02372d859b0bef", "message": "Update index.html\n\n1. Business Name in Overview Section\r\nFind (around line 400-450 in the overview section):\r\njavascript<h2 className=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">Dashboard Overview</h2>\r\n<p className=\"text-gray-400 mb-6\">Your business health and top modules at a glance</p>\r\nAdd this right after that paragraph:\r\njavascript<p className=\"text-xl text-white mb-4\">{cashFlowData ? cashFlowData.user_email.split('@')[0] + \"'s Business\" : 'Loading...'}</p>\r\n\r\n2. Revenue Display in Quick Stats\r\nFind:\r\njavascript<p className=\"text-sm text-gray-400 mb-1\">Revenue: ${businessData.monthlyRevenue.toLocaleString()}/mo</p>\r\nReplace with:\r\njavascript<p className=\"text-sm text-gray-400 mb-1\">Daily Burn: ${cashFlowData ? cashFlowData.last_30_days.avg_daily_burn : '0'}</p>\r\n\r\n3. Health Score Trend\r\nFind:\r\njavascript<span className=\"text-green-400 font-bold\">{businessData.trend} this week</span>\r\nReplace with:\r\njavascript<span className={`font-bold ${parseFloat(cashFlowData?.last_30_days.net || 0) < 0 ? 'text-red-400' : 'text-green-400'}`}>\r\n    {cashFlowData ? cashFlowData.last_30_days.net : '0'} (30 days)\r\n</span>\r\n\r\n4. Add Cash Flow Warning Banner\r\nFind the \"Dashboard Overview\" heading and right after it, add:\r\njavascript{cashFlowData?.forecast?.alert_level === 'critical' && (\r\n    <div className=\"mb-6 p-4 bg-red-900/20 border border-red-500 rounded-lg\">\r\n        <h3 className=\"text-red-400 font-bold mb-2\">\ud83d\udea8 CRITICAL: Cash Crisis Detected</h3>\r\n        <p className=\"text-sm text-gray-300\">Your business is predicted to run out of cash soon. Check the forecast details immediately.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n)}\r\n\r\n5. Show Real Transactions\r\nFind the \"Recent Insights\" section title and add this ABOVE it:\r\njavascript<div className=\"mb-8\">\r\n    <h2 className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6\">Recent Transactions</h2>\r\n    {cashFlowData && cashFlowData.recent_transactions ? (\r\n        <div className=\"space-y-3\">\r\n            {cashFlowData.recent_transactions.map((txn, idx) => (\r\n                <div key={idx} className=\"rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 to-black border border-purple-800/30 p-4 flex justify-between items-center\">\r\n                    <div>\r\n                        <p className=\"text-white font-medium\">{txn.merchant}</p>\r\n                        <p className=\"text-xs text-gray-400\">{txn.category} \u2022 {txn.date}</p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <p className={`font-bold ${txn.type === 'inflow' ? 'text-green-400' : 'text-red-400'}`}>\r\n                        {txn.type === 'inflow' ? '+' : '-'}${txn.amount}\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n            ))}\r\n        </div>\r\n    ) : <p className=\"text-gray-400\">No transactions available</p>}\r\n</div>", "created_at": "2025-10-04T20:57:56Z", "repo": "momentum.ai_landing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ad48c1fbdb3931c211181bea6b921d56166790c8", "message": "Update index.html\n\nedit webhook from http to https for testing", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:52:55Z", "repo": "momentum.ai_landing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4d8a7f2b689b58e9420bef4d6efa03c0046ccafb", "message": "Update index.html\n\nfixed broken js syntax lines 71-82", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:47:46Z", "repo": "momentum.ai_landing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cf122db019d85c376d20fa728c178feacd988d94", "message": "Update index.html\n\nchanged webhook url from https to http", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:33:06Z", "repo": "momentum.ai_landing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c7505a84ffb473465b74c14dda22aa663c0092a3", "message": "Update index.html\n\nupdated cashflow data with mock data from plaid api", "created_at": "2025-10-04T05:15:43Z", "repo": "momentum.ai_landing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b47939de3bbcc96f78babcb2f84d90f987a56397", "message": "Add files via upload\n\nadd new index.html (dashboard)", "created_at": "2025-10-04T01:08:28Z", "repo": "momentum.ai_landing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b50b55ac3952be20fa2463055ee01e028d124df4", "message": "Delete momentum_dashboard.html", "created_at": "2025-10-04T01:07:21Z", "repo": "momentum.ai_landing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "722cf943b2d0374ce7208b5294826f0f9026dfb7", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2025-10-04T01:04:59Z", "repo": "momentum.ai_landing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6412099ad7b647f33c6adabed9fa33b6bfeae386", "message": "Delete index.html", "created_at": "2025-10-04T01:04:31Z", "repo": "momentum.ai_landing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": nu